# Torch at microcube resolution (1 microcube = 1/9 unit)
# Wooden haft with a glowing head. Origin at haft base; ~0.9 units tall.
# M px py pz sx sy sz mx my mz Material

# Haft (Wood), X=4 Z=4, Y=0..5
M 0 0 0 1 0 1 1 0 1 Wood
M 0 0 0 1 0 1 1 1 1 Wood
M 0 0 0 1 0 1 1 2 1 Wood
M 0 0 0 1 1 1 1 0 1 Wood
M 0 0 0 1 1 1 1 1 1 Wood
M 0 0 0 1 1 1 1 2 1 Wood

# Burning head (glow): center column Y=6..7 plus X/Z neighbors at Y=6
M 0 0 0 1 2 1 1 0 1 glow
M 0 0 0 1 2 1 1 1 1 glow
M 0 0 0 1 2 1 0 0 1 glow
M 0 0 0 1 2 1 2 0 1 glow
M 0 0 0 1 2 1 1 0 0 glow
M 0 0 0 1 2 1 1 0 2 glow
